msgstr "<guilabel>Resynkroniser</guilabel>: Resynkroniserer de valgte emner."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: moderator_guide.xml:397
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Change topic type</guilabel>: Change the topic type to either "
